[04:15] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'cache to negate. And what you do is you just pay for all of that previous conversation over again. Changes in reasoning level are kind of more nuanced because OpenAI says they support caching across reasoning levels, but in my'

[04:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'experience, it doesn\'t appear to be true. So, I\'m not going to say that like every reasoning change will cause the cache to miss. I\'m just saying that it\'s best to choose the model and reasoning level before you start the task. I\'ll'

