[09:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'probabilistic, it just kind of ignored my instructions. I actually have to change my sub agent policy so Codex doesn\'t wing it, and you do that in the agents.md file. The important line here is default to fork turns none and'

[09:24] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: The Codex UI is shown, with the creator explaining how to modify the `agents.md` file.
AUDIO: 'provide self-contained task prompts so that Codex doesn\'t just like wing it YOLO mode and throw the entire conversation at the sub agents for no reason. The main useful application or like case for sub agents is like really high volume or specific tasks while your'

[09:37] [scene:talk]
